# Metal surfaces

Do not add horizontal lines, vertical lines, or concentric circles to a metal surface. This includes repeating linear gradients, repeating radial gradients, lathe rings, brushed stripes, and noise stretched into streaks.

Metal quality comes from light, value, and form. Do not reintroduce those line patterns in later revisions, even if the request is to add texture or a more metallic look.
